CeruleanCave_B1F_Text_Mew::
    .string "Mew!$"


CeruleanCave_B1F_Text_RedIntro::
    .string "BASIL: ...So you made it down here.\p"
    .string "I waited next to MEWTWO for a fight\n"
    .string "worth the walk.\p"
    .string "No speeches. My team does the\n"
    .string "talking.$"

CeruleanCave_B1F_Text_RedDefeat::
    .string "BASIL: ...Ha! That is the fight\n"
    .string "I was waiting for.$"

CeruleanCave_B1F_Text_RedAfter::
    .string "BASIL: MEWTWO is not my POKéMON.\n"
    .string "He is my friend.\p"
    .string "He fights at my side because he\n"
    .string "chooses to. He is free to leave\l"
    .string "whenever he wants.\p"
    .string "Free, like every POKéMON should\n"
    .string "be. Remember that.\p"
    .string "BASIL smiles and walks out.$"

CeruleanCave_B1F_Text_Epilogue::
    .string "Some time later, at a quiet harbor,\n"
    .string "a red-haired boy named SILVER\l"
    .string "watches a man he does not\l"
    .string "quite dare to call his father.\p"
    .string "Neither of them speaks. But for\n"
    .string "the first time, neither looks away.\p"
    .string "THE END... OR MAYBE JUST THE\n"
    .string "BEGINNING.$"
